      <bpmn:task id="Bridge_3_7832" name="**Transition Sentence:**  &#10;Following the resolution of insurance subrogation cases in Process A (via closure, successful payment booking, or collection agency referral), any resulting employee expense claims triggered by these resolved cases initiate Process B for reimbursement validation and disbursement.  &#10;&#10;---&#10;&#10;**Expense Reimbursement Process Design:**  &#10;```mermaid&#10;graph TD&#10;    A[Employee Submits Expense Report] --&gt; B{Account Exists?}&#10;    B -- Yes --&gt; C[Review Report]&#10;    B -- No --&gt; D[Create Account] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; E{Expense ≤ 200?}&#10;    E -- Yes --&gt; F[Reimburse via Direct Deposit] --&gt; G[End Process]&#10;    E -- No --&gt; H[Request Supervisor Approval]&#10;    H --&gt; I{Approval Outcome within 7 Days?}&#10;    I -- Approved --&gt; F&#10;    I -- Rejected --&gt; J[Notify Employee via Email] --&gt; G&#10;    I -- Timeout --&gt; K[Email Employee: Approval Pending] --&gt; H&#10;```&#10;&#10;**Key Elements:**  &#10;1. **Roles:**  &#10;   - **Employee:** Submits report, receives notifications.  &#10;   - **Supervisor:** Approves/rejects large expenses (&gt;200).  &#10;&#10;2. **Decision Points:**  &#10;   - **Account Status:** Auto-create accounts if missing (28-day deadline).  &#10;   - **Expense Amount:** ≤200: auto-reimburse; &gt;200: supervisor approval.  &#10;   - **Approval Result:** Approved (pay), Rejected (notify), Timeout (remind + loop).  &#10;&#10;3. **Critical Rules:**  &#10;   - **28-Day Deadline:** Fail account check → stop process + request resubmission.  &#10;   - **7-Day Approval SLA:** Timeout triggers reminder and re-requests approval.  &#10;&#10;**Outcome Handling:**  &#10;- ≤200: Direct deposit → Close.  &#10;- &gt;200: Approval → Pay; Rejection → Notify; Timeout → Escalate and reloop." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_3" sourceRef="atom_2_Task_9" targetRef="Bridge_3_7832" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_3" sourceRef="Bridge_3_7832" targetRef="atom_3_sid-8130C1AC-F735-4F22-8EB4-09A290306712" /><bpmn:extensionElements />
